## Invariants

{{#if sourceOnly}}
- Private to conciv and never published: its exports point at `src`, nothing builds it, and the packages that use it
  inline it into their own builds.
{{else if plugin}}
{{#if engine}}
- `src/{{name}}.ts` is the engine part (`Plugin.define` from `@conciv/backend-plugin-api/effect`), exported as `.` and
  `./server`; `tsdown` (`tsdown.config.ts`) emits its JavaScript and declarations.
{{/if}}
{{#if browserPart}}
- `src/plugin-experimental.tsx` is the browser part (`Plugin.define` from `@conciv/frontend-plugin-api`), exported as
  `./plugin-experimental`: `tsdown` emits its declarations and `vite build` (`vite.config.ts`, `experimental()`) the
  CommonJS bundle the app loads.
- Its UnoCSS sheet: `build:css` (`scripts/build-css.ts`, run first by `build`) writes `src/.generated/css.ts` from
  `pluginSheetConfig` over `src`, and the browser part adds it with `ctx.add(Style, css)`.
{{/if}}
{{else}}
- `tsdown` (`tsdown.config.ts`) emits the JavaScript and the declarations (types from `tsconfig.build.json`); its
  dependencies and peerDependencies stay external.
{{/if}}

## Side Effects

{{#if sourceOnly}}
- None: the package root holds configs and the manifest only.
{{else}}
- `build` script (`package.json`): writes dist/{{#if browserPart}}{{#if plugin}} and `src/.generated/css.ts`{{/if}}{{/if}}
{{/if}}

## Verification

- Typecheck and lint: `pnpm turbo run typecheck --filter={{packageName}}` at the repo root (turbo runs the builds it
  needs first{{#if plugin}}{{#if browserPart}}, `build:css` included, which writes `src/.generated/css.ts`{{/if}}{{/if}}), then `pnpm lint`.
- Tests: the package has no `test` script yet, because `vitest run` with no test file fails. Add
  `"test": "vitest run"` to `package.json` with the first test. {{#if browserPart}}{{#if plugin}}`vite.config.ts`{{else}}`vitest.config.ts`{{/if}}{{else}}`vitest.config.ts`{{/if}} runs `test/unit/**/*.unit.test.ts`
  and `test/it/**/*.it.test.ts`{{#if browserTests}}, and `test/e2e/**/*.e2e.test.tsx` in browser mode{{/if}}.
